# One regex per line. Links matching any line are skipped by lychee.
# Keep this short and explain every entry; an ignored link is a link nobody checks.
# Example: a vendor portal that blocks bots
# ^https://portal\.example-vendor\.com/
# Placeholder or directory URLs used as Ansible variable bases, not concrete
# release assets or doc pages that a reader should open directly.
^https://github\.com/get-sybers/lxc/releases/download/?$
^https://github\.com/semaphoreui/semaphore/releases/download/?$
^https://github\.com/Velocidex/velociraptor/releases/download/?$
^https://raw\.githubusercontent\.com/lxc/lxc-ci/(?:CHANGE-ME-commit|<commit>)/images/debian\.yaml$
^https://codeload\.github\.com/cmu-sei/GHOSTS/tar\.gz/refs/tags/?$
^https://deb\.nodesource\.com/node_/?$
